{"id":"T5-083","set":5,"qno":83,"page":18,"topic":"团队思维/群体思维","bok":"III","difficulty":1,"question":"在一个项目进度会议中，一位高级工程师建议改变客户服务流程。虽然好几个项目成员认为改变会疏远其中一个大客户，但大家还是急匆匆地去识别这一新变化的潜在利益。这种现象叫？","options":["一致共识","授权","以顾客为中心","团队思维"],"answer":3,"explanation":"成员压抑异议、急于寻求利益的现象即团队思维（groupthink）。","question_en":"In a project progress meeting, a senior engineer suggested changing the customer service process. Although several project members believed that the change would alienate one of the major customers, everyone rushed to identify the potential benefits of this/ new change. This phenomenon is called?","options_en":["Unanimous consensus","Authorization","Customer-centric","Team thinking"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-084","set":5,"qno":84,"page":18,"topic":"测量系统分析/R&R","bok":"V","difficulty":1,"question":"重复性和再现性（R&R）研究用于分析下列哪种情况？","options":["在受控环境下，量具相对于已知标准的精确度","在受控环境下，量具相对于已知标准的准确度","量具测量的变化和操作人员测值的变化","量具测量的偏差相比于操作人员测量的偏差"],"answer":2,"explanation":"量具R&R分析量具重复性（设备）与再现性（操作员）的变异。","question_en":"Repeatability and reproducibility (R&R) research is used to analyze which of the following situations?","options_en":["In a controlled environment, the accuracy of the measuring tool relative to a known standard","In a controlled environment, the accuracy of the measuring tool relative to a known standard","The change of measuring tool measurement and the change of operator's measurement value |","The deviation measured by the measuring tool is compared with the deviation measured by the operator"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-085","set":5,"qno":85,"page":19,"topic":"控制图子组选择","bok":"VIII","difficulty":2,"question":"在控制图样本中。以下哪个判定标准可用来选择合理子组？","options":["高 最小化","高 最大化","低 最小化","低 最大化"],"answer":1,"explanation":"合理子组原则要求组内变异尽量小、组间变异尽量大（即最大化组间差异/组内同质性），答案B（最大化）符合。","question_en":"In the sample control chart. Which of the following criteria can be used to select a reasonable subgroup? Same property within subgroup Same property within subgroup","options_en":["High Minimize","High maximum","Low Minimize","Low maximize"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-086","set":5,"qno":86,"page":19,"topic":"DMADV阶段","bok":"IX","difficulty":2,"question":"在DMADV项目测量阶段会发生下列哪个行为？","options":["在试运行阶段评估关键质量因子结果（CTQ）","为关键质量（CTQ）需求制定参数","把需求和设计特征联系起来","确定新过程的能力"],"answer":1,"explanation":"DMADV 的测量阶段负责识别并定义关键质量特性（CTQ）的度量参数与指标，为后续分析/设计建立量化基础；评估 CTQ 结果、关联需求与设计特征、确定新过程能力分别属于验证、分析/设计和验证阶段。","dupOf":"T2-091","question_en":"Which of the following behaviors will occur during the measurement phase of the DMADV project?","options_en":["Evaluation of key quality factor results (CTQ) during the trial operation phase","Develop parameters for critical quality (CTQ) requirements","Link requirements and design features","The ability to determine the new process"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-087","set":5,"qno":87,"page":19,"topic":"控制图模式识别","bok":"VIII","difficulty":1,"question":"下面的控制图由一个持续改善小组监制。在这个途中的过程显示一种模式被称为【图题：控制图显示过程波动模式】。","options":["偏移","趋势","周期","分层"],"answer":0,"explanation":"控制图模式识别需依据图中点的走向判定；本题原图缺失，图题仅泛称“过程波动模式”，无法独立确认是偏移/趋势/周期/分层中的哪一种。","figure":true,"review":"needs_review","reviewNote":"答案键存疑：原图缺失，给定答案(0=偏移)无法独立核验，建议对照原卷图形确认。","figureImg":"figures/T5-087.png","question_en":"The control chart below is supervised by a continuous improvement team. The process on this way shows a pattern called","options_en":["Offset","Trend","Period","Stratification"]},
{"id":"T5-088","set":5,"qno":88,"page":20,"topic":"残差图分析","bok":"VI","difficulty":2,"question":"下面比较残差和拟合度的图。基于这个图，如果有的话，可以归纳出下面哪个结论？【图题：残差与拟合度散点图】。","options":["方差相等","方差正在减少","方差正在增加","不足够信息去归纳出结论。"],"answer":2,"explanation":"残差-拟合图用于判断方差齐性：残差随拟合值变宽则方差增大、变窄则减小、均匀则相等；本题原图缺失，无法确认方差变化趋势。","figure":true,"review":"needs_review","reviewNote":"答案键存疑：原图缺失，给定答案(2=方差正在增加)无法独立核验，建议对照原图确认。","figureImg":"figures/T5-088.png","question_en":"Below is a graph comparing residuals and goodness of fit. Based on this graph, if there is one, which conclusion can be drawn?","options_en":["Equal variances","The variance is decreasing","Variance is increasing","There is not enough information to summarize the theory."]},
{"id":"T5-089","set":5,"qno":89,"page":20,"topic":"稳健设计","bok":"IX","difficulty":2,"question":"在稳健过程设计中，关键目标是","options":["符合顾客规则要求","对环境因素影响的最小化","纠正措施文件建","过程能力指标大于1.00"],"answer":1,"explanation":"稳健设计（田口方法）的核心目标是使产品或过程对噪声/环境因素波动不敏感，即最小化环境因素的影响，从而在变异环境下仍保持稳定性能。","review":"needs_review","reviewNote":"选项C“纠正措施文件建”疑缺“立”字、语义残缺，但非答案项，作答不受影响。","question_en":"In the stable key process design, the key goal is","options_en":["Meet the requirements of customer regulations","Minimize the impact on environmental factors","Corrective action document establishment","The process capability index is greater than 1.00"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-090","set":5,"qno":90,"page":20,"topic":"中心极限定理与概率","bok":"V","difficulty":3,"question":"工作为总体，当前在公司的平均工作年限是2.5年。标准差3年。如果从总体中随机挑选36人为样本，该样本平均工作年限超过3.5年的概率是？","options":["0.02","0.48","0.50","0.98"],"answer":0,"explanation":"由中心极限定理，样本均值标准误 SE=σ/√n=3/√36=0.5，Z=(3.5−2.5)/0.5=2，P(X̄>3.5)=P(Z>2)≈0.0228，约0.02。","question_en":"Work as a whole, the current average working life in the company is 2.5 years. The standard deviation is 3 years. If 36 people are randomly selected from the population as a sample, what is the probability that the average working life of the sample exceeds 3.5 years?","options_en":["0.02","0.48","0.50","0.98"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-091","set":5,"qno":91,"page":20,"topic":"过程主管角色","bok":"I","difficulty":1,"question":"在六西格玛项目中，过程主管最好的定义是","options":["为试生产结果设置标准","保证改进有成效并不断维持","领导DMAIC的各种阶段","为图形分析报告制定主要的评估指数"],"answer":1,"explanation":"过程主管（Process Owner）对所属流程负责，核心职责是确保改进成果有效落地并长期维持。","question_en":"In the Six Sigma project, the best definition of process supervisor is","options_en":["Setting standards for trial production results","Ensure that the improvement is effective and continuous","Leading various stages of DMAIC","Develop the main evaluation index for the graphic analysis report"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-092","set":5,"qno":92,"page":21,"topic":"流程图目的","bok":"IV","difficulty":1,"question":"在一个六西格玛项目中创建流程图的最好原因","options":["为书面程序提供一个可视帮助","对如何实际地实施过程获得理解","识别项目目标及目的","展示执行管理目前执行的过程水平"],"answer":1,"explanation":"流程图的主要价值在于让团队与实际执行者就“过程实际如何运作”达成共识，从而发现冗余、瓶颈与改进机会。","question_en":"The best reason to create a flowchart in a Six Sigma project","options_en":["Provide a visual aid to the written procedure","Gain an understanding of how to actually implement the process","Identify project goals and objectives","Demonstrate the current process level of executive management"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-093","set":5,"qno":93,"page":21,"topic":"标杆管理类型","bok":"II","difficulty":1,"question":"用来对比不同行业类似流程时，以下哪种类型标杆管理较合适？","options":["职能的","内部的","协调的","竞争的"],"answer":0,"explanation":"职能标杆（Functional benchmarking）跨行业比较相同或相似职能/流程的最佳实践，适用于不同行业类似流程的对比。","dupOf":"T3-071","question_en":"When comparing similar processes in different industries, which of the following types of benchmarking is more appropriate?","options_en":["Functional","Internal","coordinated","Competitive"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-094","set":5,"qno":94,"page":21,"topic":"约束理论","bok":"II","difficulty":1,"question":"约束理论中，一系列相互关联的过程的绩效由下列哪个因素来驱动","options":["绩效最弱的独立过程","绩效最强的独立过程","运营部门职员","过程要求的报废或返工比率"],"answer":0,"explanation":"约束理论（TOC）认为系统的整体产出由最薄弱的环节（约束/瓶颈）决定，即绩效最弱的独立过程。","dupOf":"T4-127","question_en":"In the theory of constraints, the performance of a series of interrelated processes is driven by which of the following factors","options_en":["Independent process with the weakest performance","Independent process with the strongest performance","Staff of the operating department","The scrap or rework rate required by the process"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-095","set":5,"qno":95,"page":21,"topic":"团队沟通计划","bok":"III","difficulty":1,"question":"下列哪个工具六西格玛团队在第一次或第二次会议中应开发出来，以保持项目相关方被知会？","options":["项目章程","过程决定项目图","甘特图","沟通计划"],"answer":3,"explanation":"沟通计划（Communication Plan）在团队早期（首次/二次会议）制定，用于规定向相关方汇报项目进展的频率与方式，保持相关方知会。","question_en":"Which of the following tools should the Six Sigma team develop in the first or second meeting to keep the project stakeholders informed?","options_en":["Project Charter","Process decision project diagram","Gantt chart","Communication plan X"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-096","set":5,"qno":96,"page":21,"topic":"控制图作用","bok":"VIII","difficulty":1,"question":"什么是过程控制图的首要作用","options":["确定过程均值变量均值的操作点","识别在过程中可能的问题或异常的事件","验证过程能力超过目标","在规格界限和控制限之间维持恰当的关系"],"answer":1,"explanation":"控制图的首要作用是通过区分普通原因与特殊原因变异，及时识别过程中出现的异常或潜在问题。","question_en":"What is the primary role of process control charts","options_en":["Determine the operating point of the mean value of the process mean variable","Identify possible problems or abnormal events in the process","Verify that the process capability exceeds the target","Maintain an appropriate relationship between specification limits and control limits"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-097","set":5,"qno":97,"page":22,"topic":"增值活动识别","bok":"VI","difficulty":1,"question":"以下哪项活动不属于增值活动？","options":["完善物品的运输文件","将客户要求的标签放在物品上","在进行QC检验之前保持半成品状态","将备件放入集装箱内"],"answer":2,"explanation":"在QC检验前持有半成品属于等待/在制品库存，不增加客户认可的价值，是典型的非增值活动；贴标签、装箱、完善运输文件属客户要求的增值或必要活动。","question_en":"Which of the following activities is not a value-added activity?","options_en":["Improve the transportation documents of the goods","Put the label required by the customer on the item","Maintain semi-finished products before QC inspection","Put the spare parts in the container"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-098","set":5,"qno":98,"page":22,"topic":"一元回归模型","bok":"VII","difficulty":2,"question":"在试验设计（DOE）中，下列哪个公式是一元回归模型？【图题：四个公式选项，含线性模型、含交互项/二次项模型及SSt、SSe公式】。","options":["y = β0 - β1x1 - β2x2 - ... - βkxk + ε","y = β0 - Σβixi - Σβiixi_i² + ΣΣβijxixj + ε","SSt = Σ(yij - y)²","SSe = Σ(yi - ŷ)²"],"answer":0,"explanation":"一元（线性）回归模型为一次线性形式 y=β0+β1x1+…+βkxk+ε（选项0）；选项1含二次项与交互项属二阶响应面模型，选项2、3为平方和而非模型本身。","figure":true,"figureImg":"figures/T5-098.png","question_en":"In the design of experiment (DOE), which of the following formulas is a univariate regression model?","options_en":["y = Po-Px -Pat2- •+P2TI -E ..,2P7i,-0 (Biy=By-","","SS:= 20-1)\"","SS: = 20:-1)3"]},
{"id":"T5-099","set":5,"qno":99,"page":22,"topic":"VOC与改进区域","bok":"IV","difficulty":1,"question":"除了顾客之声的信息之外，应该审核下列哪项输入识别需要改进的额外区域？","options":["员工建议","员工绩效记录","担保政策","文件控制程序"],"answer":0,"explanation":"除顾客之声（VOC）外，一线员工建议是识别改进机会的重要内部输入，能反映过程实际问题与改善点。","question_en":"In addition to the information from Customer Voice, which of the following inputs should be reviewed to identify additional areas that need improvement?","options_en":["Staff suggestion","Employee performance record","Guarantee policy","Document control program"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-100","set":5,"qno":100,"page":22,"topic":"可维护性设计","bok":"IX","difficulty":1,"question":"下列哪个因素在可维护性设计中应考虑？","options":["定期服务的频率","产品失效模式","过程输入变量","顾客投诉数量"],"answer":1,"explanation":"可维护性设计需考虑产品的失效模式（FMEA），以便使故障可被快速探测与修复、缩短维修时间（MTTR）；服务频率属维护计划而非设计输入。","question_en":"Which of the following factors should be considered in maintainability design?","options_en":["Frequency of regular service","Product failure mode","Process input variables. ‹","Number of customer complaints"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-101","set":5,"qno":101,"page":22,"topic":"团队发展阶段","bok":"III","difficulty":1,"question":"当团队成员满意团队的进程并相互之间关系融洽时，团队处于什么发展阶段？","options":["形成","震荡","规范","执行"],"answer":3,"explanation":"团队发展阶段中，“执行期（Performing）”成员关系融洽、对流程满意并能高效自主工作。","question_en":"When team members are satisfied with the progress of the team and have a harmonious relationship with each other, what stage of development is the team in?","options_en":["Formation","Concussion","Specification","Execution"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-102","set":5,"qno":102,"page":23,"topic":"标准误差计算","bok":"V","difficulty":2,"question":"一个过程的标准偏差是50，如果从一个过程中抽取25个样本，下列样本均值的标准误差是","options":["1.4","2.0","7.1","10.0"],"answer":3,"explanation":"样本均值的标准误差 SE=σ/√n=50/√25=50/5=10。","question_en":"The standard deviation of a process is 50. If 25 samples are taken from a process, the standard error of the mean of the following samples is","options_en":["1.4","2.0","7.1","10.0"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-103","set":5,"qno":103,"page":23,"topic":"标杆策划","bok":"II","difficulty":1,"question":"在标杆策划阶段，下列哪个活动会发生？","options":["预计将来的绩效水平","识别改善的领域","确认当前内部流程所受威胁","采纳竞争对手的实践措施"],"answer":2,"explanation":"（存疑）标杆策划阶段的核心活动是确定标杆对象并识别需改善的领域（选项1“识别改善的领域”）；给定的“确认当前内部流程所受威胁”(选项2)更偏竞争分析，建议核对原卷。","review":"needs_review","reviewNote":"答案键存疑：标准答案给2；标杆策划阶段典型活动应为“识别改善的领域”(选项1，索引1)，建议确认。","question_en":"In the benchmarking stage, which of the following activities will occur?","options_en":["Expected future performance level","Identify areas for improvement","Confirm the current threats to internal processes","Adopt the practical measures of competitors"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-104","set":5,"qno":104,"page":23,"topic":"直通率与精益","bok":"VII","difficulty":1,"question":"为提高生产过程中的直通率，改进团队应采取下列哪个措施？","options":["减少库存","降低缺陷","开发生产矩阵","使用5S"],"answer":1,"explanation":"直通率（RTY）为各工序一次合格率之积，降低缺陷可直接提升各工序一次合格率，从而提高整体直通率。","question_en":"In order to increase the straight-through rate in the production process, which of the following measures should the improvement team take?","options_en":["Reduce inventory","Reduce defects","Development and production matrix","Use 5S"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-105","set":5,"qno":105,"page":23,"topic":"团队角色职责","bok":"III","difficulty":1,"question":"谁对保证团队成员理解战略目标负主要责任？","options":["推动者","黑带","黑带大师","流程负责人"],"answer":0,"explanation":"推动者/倡导者（项目赞助人）对项目的战略对齐负责，须确保团队成员理解项目与组织战略目标的关联。","question_en":"Who is primarily responsible for ensuring that team members understand the strategic goals?","options_en":["Promoter","Black belt","Master Black Belt","Process leader"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-106","set":5,"qno":106,"page":23,"topic":"X̄控制图控制限","bok":"VIII","difficulty":3,"question":"下列数据可用于分析\nR̄=1.59\nX̄=10.66\n子组个数=20\n样本数=5\n基于以上信息，X̄图中控制上限是多少？【图题：给出R̄、X̄、子组个数与样本数，计算X̄图UCL】。","options":["9.74","10.95","11.58","11.82"],"answer":2,"explanation":"X̄图 UCL=X̄+A2·R̄；n=5 时 A2=0.577，UCL=10.66+0.577×1.59=10.66+0.917≈11.58。","figure":false,"question_en":"The following data can be used for analysis R=1.59 X=10.66 Number of self-group = 20 Number of samples = 5 Based on the above information, what is the upper limit of control in the figure?","options_en":["9.74","10.95","11.58","11.82"]},
{"id":"T5-107","set":5,"qno":107,"page":24,"topic":"多轮投票时机","bok":"III","difficulty":1,"question":"对于一个团队在下列哪种情况后是使用多轮投票的最佳时机","options":["团队冲突已被解决","项目的定义阶段完成","头脑风暴完成","团队成员已声明对建议过的想法或方案拥有所有权"],"answer":2,"explanation":"多轮投票（Multi-voting）用于在头脑风暴产生大量想法后，由团队逐步收敛、排出优先顺序，故最佳时机是头脑风暴完成之后。","question_en":"For a team in which of the following situations is the best time to use multiple rounds of voting","options_en":["The team conflict has been resolved","The definition phase of the project is completed","Brainstorming completed","Team members have declared ownership of the ideas or plans that have been built"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-108","set":5,"qno":108,"page":24,"topic":"MSA标准差","bok":"V","difficulty":2,"question":"在测量系统分析中。使用下到哪个公式用于计算整体的测量体系标准差","options":["A2R̄","D4R̄","[5.15σm / 公差](100)","√(σe² + σo²)"],"answer":3,"explanation":"测量系统总标准差由重复性（设备，σe）与再现性（操作员，σo）合成：σm=√(σe²+σo²)（选项3）。","question_en":"In the measurement system analysis. Which formula is used to calculate the standard deviation of the overall measurement system","options_en":["AZR","DAR","LL5.1ance| (100)","Voệ +o?"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-109","set":5,"qno":109,"page":24,"topic":"团队冲突解决","bok":"III","difficulty":2,"question":"由于对管理目标的分歧导致黑带管理的闭队遇到了组织性的问题。为帮助解决这种状况：黑带首先应该：","options":["要求团队将引发分歧的目标列出优先度","召集那些目标分歧的经理开会","建议团队忽略分歧","按经理们的级别高低进行目标的优先度排列"],"answer":0,"explanation":"面对因目标分歧导致的组织冲突，黑带应首先引导团队将分歧目标列出并排序，以结构化方式澄清优先度，而非回避或越级。","question_en":"Due to the divergence of management objectives, the closed team of black belt management encountered organizational problems. To help solve this situation: the black belt should first! |","options_en":["Ask the team to prioritize the goal that caused the disagreement","Convene a meeting for managers with different goals","Advise the team to ignore differences","Prioritize the goals according to the level of managers"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-110","set":5,"qno":110,"page":24,"topic":"自主团队权限","bok":"III","difficulty":1,"question":"一个自主领导的团队应该有权利","options":["为提高效率设立奖金","评估团队成员的表现","创建公司政策管理团队期望","在组织内调任团队成员"],"answer":3,"explanation":"自主领导团队拥有较高自主权，可在组织内调任/安排团队成员以匹配任务需要；设奖金、评绩效、定政策属管理层职权。","dupOf":"T4-023","question_en":"A self-led team should have the right","options_en":["Set up bonuses to improve efficiency-","Evaluate the performance of team members","Create company policy management team expectations","Transfer team members within the organization X"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-111","set":5,"qno":111,"page":25,"topic":"假设检验选择","bok":"VI","difficulty":2,"question":"一上班的人想确定2条路线中的一条上班，如果X比Y路线显示出更多的交通，该人应该测试下列哪个零假设检验？","options":["路线X和路线Y将花费相同的时间去上班","路线X比路线Y花费更多的时间去上班","每条路线都将花费显著不同的时间","路线X比路线Y在去上班的交通时间有更多的变量"],"answer":0,"explanation":"检验“X路线交通是否多于Y”时，原假设通常设为两路线无差异（花费相同时间），备择为X>Y，故选项0为恰当的零假设表述。","question_en":"A person at work wants to determine one of the two routes to work, if X Shows more traffic than Route Y. Which of the following null hypothesis tests should the person test?","options_en":["Route X and Route Y will take the same time to go to work","Route X takes more time to go to work than Route Y","Each route will take significantly different time","Route X has more variables in the travel time to work than route Y"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-112","set":5,"qno":112,"page":25,"topic":"项目目标与战略对齐","bok":"I","difficulty":1,"question":"六西格玛项目的目标和使命陈述应该受下列哪个因素驱动？","options":["企业战略","项目团队成员","项目经理","项目计划"],"answer":0,"explanation":"六西格玛项目目标与使命应由企业战略驱动，确保项目与组织战略重点一致。","question_en":"Which of the following factors should be driven by the goals and mission statement of the Six Sigma project?","options_en":["Corporate strategy","Project team members","Project manager","Project plan"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-113","set":5,"qno":113,"page":25,"topic":"双样本t检验","bok":"VI","difficulty":2,"question":"一个六西格玛项目团队在审核某产品部件1和部件2的双样本t-检验的数据时，方差不能假设为相等。基于上述信息，该试验可得出什么结论？【图题：双样本t检验结果表，含部件1 n=13/均值42.580/标准差1.720/均值标准误0.48，部件2 n=15/均值38.387/标准差0.741/均值标准误0.19；α=0.05，差值估计4.193，95%置信区间(3.097,5.289)，t值8.14，P值0.000，DF=15】","options":["不能拒绝均值相等的原假设","不能拒绝方差相等的原假设","拒绝均值相等的原假设","拒绝方差相等的原假设"],"answer":2,"explanation":"方差不等时采用 Welch 双样本t检验；t=8.14、P=0.000<0.05，且差值95%置信区间不含0，故拒绝均值相等的原假设。","figure":true,"figureImg":"figures/T5-113.png","question_en":"When a six sigma project team reviews the data of a two-sample t-test for part 1 and part 2 of a product, the variances cannot be assumed to be equal. Based on the above information, what conclusions can be drawn from the test? Standard Mean deviation 1.720 13 42.580 partl 0. 741 15 38.387 part2 a =0.05 Difference = # part 1-u part2 Estimated difference = 4.193- 95% confidence interval of difference (3.097, 5.289) t-value = 8.14 P-value=0.000 DF=15","options_en":["The null hypothesis that the means are equal cannot be rejected","The null hypothesis that the variances are equal cannot be rejected","Reject the null hypothesis that the means are equal","Reject the null hypothesis that the variances are equal"]},
{"id":"T5-114","set":5,"qno":114,"page":26,"topic":"团队成员选择","bok":"III","difficulty":1,"question":"为一个项目团队选择团队成员，下列哪个方法有助于团队是有效的？","options":["面谈那些对该项目没兴趣的雇员","专门为该团队配备有项目管理经验的专家","分派高级经理和操作员的组合来确保组织认同","识别各区域和工作层面受项目影响的雇员"],"answer":3,"explanation":"有效团队应覆盖受项目影响的各区域与层级（跨职能代表），以确保组织认同与多角度输入。","question_en":"To select team members for a project team, which of the following methods helps the team to be effective?","options_en":["Interview employees who are not interested in the project","Specially equipped the team with experts with project management experience","Assign a combination of senior managers and operators to ensure organizational identity","Identify employees affected by the project in each area and work level"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-115","set":5,"qno":115,"page":26,"topic":"零假设","bok":"VI","difficulty":1,"question":"在零假设中，两个样本间的均值差异被假设等于","options":["0.95","0.05","0.01","0.00"],"answer":3,"explanation":"零假设通常假定两组均值无差异，即均值差等于0.00。","question_en":"In the null hypothesis, the mean difference between two samples is assumed to be equal to","options_en":["0.95","0.05","0.01","0.00"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-116","set":5,"qno":116,"page":26,"topic":"SWOT分析","bok":"I","difficulty":1,"question":"以下SWOT图创建于计划阶段。S-O方格表示下列哪种说法？【图题：SWOT矩阵表，行：机会/威胁，列：强项/弱项，单元格S-O/W-O/S-T/W-T】","options":["为寻找机会公司必须克服一个区域","该区域是公司的强项可以减少外部威胁的影响","该区域公司可以发展成为竞争优势","该区域存在于业务因素中可以是公司处于竞争的劣势"],"answer":2,"explanation":"SWOT 中 S-O（强项-机会）格表示利用公司强项去抓住外部机会、发展为竞争优势，对应选项“可发展成为竞争优势”。","figure":true,"figureImg":"figures/T5-116.png","question_en":"The following SWOT diagram was created in the planning stage. Strengths Opportunity S-O S-T Threats Which of the following statements does the S-0 box indicate?","options_en":["In order to find opportunities the company must overcome an area","This area is the company's strengths and can reduce the impact of external threats","Companies in this area can develop into a competitive advantage","The existence of this area in business factors can be a competitive disadvantage for the company"]},
{"id":"T5-117","set":5,"qno":117,"page":27,"topic":"质量成本","bok":"II","difficulty":1,"question":"下表列出了一个公司的产品的质量成本。该产品的鉴定成本是？【图题：质量成本表，项目：报废$800、过程控制培训$1000、来料检验$500、进程检验$200、顾客投诉控制$2000】","options":["$500","$700","$1700","$2200"],"answer":1,"explanation":"鉴定成本含来料检验$500与过程检验$200，合计$700；报废与顾客投诉属失效成本，过程控制培训属预防成本。","figure":true,"figureImg":"figures/T5-117.png","question_en":"The following table lists the quality cost of a company's products. The identification product? $800 Scrap $1000 Process control training $500 Incoming inspection $200 Process inspection Customer complaint control $2000","options_en":["$500","$700","$1700","$2200"]},
{"id":"T5-118","set":5,"qno":118,"page":27,"topic":"六西格玛目标","bok":"I","difficulty":1,"question":"六西格玛计划旨在","options":["在整个组织中沟通主要的过程变更","针对长期和短期节省金额来定义利润","改进新产品的设计过程","改进过程以最大限度地减少缺陷和变异"],"answer":3,"explanation":"六西格玛的核心目标是改进过程、最大限度减少缺陷与变异（波动），从而接近每百万3.4缺陷。","question_en":"The Six Sigma Plan aims to","options_en":["Communicate major process changes throughout the organization","Define profit for long-term and short-term savings","Improve the design process of new products","Improve the process to minimize defects and variations"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-119","set":5,"qno":119,"page":27,"topic":"SIPOC应用","bok":"IV","difficulty":1,"question":"下面哪种情况应该用SIPOC？","options":["一个团队需要开发对一个过程的共识","一个团队需要解决团队成员间的冲突","管理层需要理解为什么一个过程需要改善","管理层需要做出人事决定。"],"answer":0,"explanation":"SIPOC 用于在高层次上描绘供方-输入-过程-输出-顾客，帮助团队对过程范围与要素建立共识。","question_en":"In which of the following situations should SIPOC be used?","options_en":["A team needs to develop a consensus on a process","A team needs to resolve conflicts between team members","Management needs to understand why al process needs improvement","Management needs to make personnel decisions."],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-120","set":5,"qno":120,"page":28,"topic":"关键路径计算","bok":"I","difficulty":3,"question":"项目开始时，一黑带发现要完成项目F需要额外30天，活动B可提前8天完成。基于该信息，完成该项目的最少天数是多少？【图题：项目网络图，活动A/B/C/D/E/F/G历时分别为10/15/10/10/5/10/25天，依赖关系A→B，B→C/D，C→End，D→G→End，D→E→F→End】","options":["60","67","72","85"],"answer":2,"explanation":"关键路径 A-B-D-G=10+15+10+25=60；F需+30天(=40)、B提前8天(=7)后，路径 A-B-D-E-F=10+7+10+5+40=72 成为最长，故最少需72天。","figure":true,"figureImg":"figures/T5-120.png","question_en":"At the beginning of the project, a black belt found that it would take an extra 30 days to complete project F, and activity B could be completed 8 days in advance. Based on this information, what is the minimum number of days to complete the project?","options_en":["60","67","72","85"]},
{"id":"T5-121","set":5,"qno":121,"page":28,"topic":"关键路径识别","bok":"I","difficulty":2,"question":"这个项目的关键路径是【图题：项目网络图，活动A/B/C/D/E/F/G历时分别为10/15/10/10/5/10/25天，依赖关系A→B，B→C/D，C→End，D→G→End，D→E→F→End】","options":["ABC","ABDG","ABEF","ABDEF"],"answer":1,"explanation":"各路径时长：ABC=35、ABDG=60、ABEF=40、ABDEF=50，最长路径 ABDG=60 为关键路径。","figure":true,"figureImg":"figures/T5-121.png","question_en":"The critical path of this project is","options_en":["ABC","ABDG","ABEF","ABDEF ‡ìt#Д⅔ì#UП/51"]},
{"id":"T5-122","set":5,"qno":122,"page":28,"topic":"宽裕时间/浮动时间","bok":"I","difficulty":2,"question":"活动C的宽裕时间是【图题：项目网络图，活动A/B/C/D/E/F/G历时分别为10/15/10/10/5/10/25天，依赖关系A→B，B→C/D，C→End，D→G→End，D→E→F→End】","options":["0","10","25","40"],"answer":2,"explanation":"活动C位于路径 A-B-C=35，项目总工期（关键路径ABDG）=60，故C的宽裕时间=60−35=25天。","figure":true,"figureImg":"figures/T5-122.png","question_en":"The slack time for activity C is","options_en":["O","10","25","40"]},
{"id":"T5-123","set":5,"qno":123,"page":29,"topic":"亲和图","bok":"VI","difficulty":1,"question":"一个六西格玛团队会议的输出信息如下。所列信息可作为下列哪个工具的案例？【图题：团队会议输出信息表，主题为\"为什么我们正在失去市场份额？\"，按项目/员工/技术等维度分类，含供货有限、缺少销售或技术代表、经理职位空缺、优秀人员需要领导、有限的广播规则、高科技老机器、交互跃进技术、当前系统能力有限等条目】","options":["相互关系图","立场分析图","为什么-为什么图","亲和图"],"answer":3,"explanation":"将零散观点按主题归类分组是亲和图（KJ法）的典型应用，用于把大量语言数据整理为有结构的类别。","figure":true,"figureImg":"figures/T5-123.png","question_en":"The output information of a Six Sigma team meeting is as follows wлкй оf пN Why are we losing Market Share? Staft Program Not enough Limied sales or tech offenes reps Manager Demo- position graphics out empty of date Good people: Old products need leaders new pamnt Need fresh material The listed interest rate can be used as an example of which of the following tools?","options_en":["Correlation diagram","Position analysis chart","Why-why diagram","Affinity diagram"]},
{"id":"T5-124","set":5,"qno":124,"page":29,"topic":"部分因子设计/混杂","bok":"VII","difficulty":2,"question":"双因子交互和部分或所有主效应，在分辨率III的部分因子设计的关系可以被描述为","options":["被阻断","混杂","直交","计划分组"],"answer":1,"explanation":"分辨率III的部分因子设计中，主效应与双因子交互作用发生混杂（confounded），无法分离估计。","question_en":"The relationship between the two-factor interaction and some or all of the main effects, and the partiak40 #X factorial design at resolution III can be described as","options_en":["blocked ‡ìt#Дì#","Mixed","Orthogonal","Plan grouping"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-125","set":5,"qno":125,"page":30,"topic":"项目角色与资源","bok":"I","difficulty":1,"question":"为所需的软件升级得到财力资源，团队领导者应该问下列哪方先说？","options":["团队协调者","项目倡导者","部门经理","采购总监"],"answer":0,"explanation":"（存疑）获取项目所需财力资源应先向项目倡导者/赞助人（Champion，选项B=项目倡导者，索引1）申请，因其掌握预算与资源授权；给定的“团队协调者”(选项0)通常无财权。","review":"needs_review","reviewNote":"答案键存疑：标准答案给0(团队协调者)；获取财力资源应先找项目倡导者/赞助人(选项1，索引1)，建议确认。","question_en":"To obtain financial resources for the required software upgrades, the team leader should ask which of the following first?","options_en":["Team pair coordinator","Project advocate","Department Manager","Purchasing Director"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-126","set":5,"qno":126,"page":30,"topic":"团队工具/头脑风暴","bok":"III","difficulty":1,"question":"如果采购升级软件所需资源不能到位，下面的哪个工具应当可以帮助团队识别出一个备选方案？","options":["因果图","PERT图","立场分析","头脑风暴"],"answer":3,"explanation":"当既定资源无法到位时，头脑风暴可用于激发备选方案与替代路径，故适用。","question_en":"If the resources needed to purchase and upgrade the software are not in place, which of the following tools should help the team identify an alternative?","options_en":["Cause and effect diagram","PERT chart","Position analysis","Brainstorm"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-127","set":5,"qno":127,"page":30,"topic":"控制阶段关口评审","bok":"VIII","difficulty":1,"question":"在控制阶段，一个六西格玛项目赞助人使用关口评审检查表。下面哪些项目应该在这份检查表上？","options":["试点测试和全面实施","根本原因分析和改正行动计划","为可持续性而准备的文件和测量","细节化的价值流图和工艺流程图"],"answer":2,"explanation":"控制阶段关口评审关注改进成果的可持续性，检查表应包含为维持效果所准备的文件与测量（控制计划、监控指标等）。","question_en":"In the control phase, a six sigma project sponsor uses a gateway review checklist. Which of the following items should be on this checklist?","options_en":["Pilot testing and full implementation","Root cause analysis and corrective action plan","Documents and measurements prepared for sustainability","Detailed value stream diagram and process flow diagram"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-128","set":5,"qno":128,"page":30,"topic":"独立事件概率","bok":"V","difficulty":1,"question":"两个相同的独立过程在运行，每个过程在可接受范围内运行的概率是0.90，那么这两个过程都在可接受范围内运行的概率为？","options":["0.19","0.81","0.90","0.99"],"answer":1,"explanation":"两独立过程均处于可接受范围的概率=0.90×0.90=0.81。","question_en":"Two identical independent processes are running, and the probability of each process running within the acceptable range is 0.90. What is the probability that both processes are running within the acceptable range?","options_en":["0.19","0.81","0.90","0.99"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-129","set":5,"qno":129,"page":31,"topic":"质量成本（外部失效）","bok":"II","difficulty":1,"question":"下列哪项质量成本应归类为外部失效成本？","options":["实施测量系统分析","检测被客户退回的产品","通过破坏实验评估最终产品样本","在供应源头检测原材料"],"answer":1,"explanation":"外部失效成本指产品交付后因失效产生的成本，处理客户退回产品属此类；MSA、破坏实验、来料检验属鉴定或预防成本。","question_en":"Which of the following quality costs should be classified as external failure costs?","options_en":["Perform measurement system analysis","Detect products returned by customers","Evaluation of final product samples destruction experiments","Detect raw materials at the source of the supplier"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-130","set":5,"qno":130,"page":31,"topic":"简单线性回归","bok":"V","difficulty":2,"question":"一个滚轮的润滑效率被测量并显示在下面结果中：润滑 1.0/1.25/1.50/2.0，服务时间 46/58/69/91。使用时间 y 和润滑时间 x 的回归方程式？","options":["Y=1.6+44.8x","Y=1.43+48.4x","Y=44.8+1.6x","Y=48.4+1.43x"],"answer":0,"explanation":"回归得斜率 b1=Sxy/Sxx=24.5/0.546875=44.8，截距 b0=66−44.8×1.4375=1.6，故 Y=1.6+44.8x（选项0）。","figure":true,"figureImg":"figures/T5-130.png","question_en":"The lubrication efficiency of a roller is measured and displayed in the result below Lubrication 1.0 1.25 Service hours 46 58 The regression equation of using time y and lubricating time x?","options_en":["Y=1.6+44.8x","Y=1.43+48.4x","Y=44.8+1.6x","Y=48.4+1.43x"]},
{"id":"T5-131","set":5,"qno":131,"page":31,"topic":"团队激励与促进者技巧","bok":"III","difficulty":1,"question":"某六西格玛团队在实现团队既定目标方面进展缓慢，这令他们感到气馁，促进者应使用下列哪种技术来鼓励和激励团队？","options":["制定短期改进措施","请管理层代表激励团队","鼓励团队重新制定目标","缩短项目期限"],"answer":0,"explanation":"团队受挫进展缓慢时，推动者可通过设立短期改进措施/速赢（quick wins）重建信心与动力。","question_en":"A certain Six Sigma team is making slow progress in achieving the team' s set goals, which makes them feel discouraged. Which of the following techniques should the facilitator use to encourage and motivate the team?","options_en":["Develop short-term improvement measures","Ask the management representative to encourage the team to","Encourage the team to redesign","Shorten the project duration"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-132","set":5,"qno":132,"page":31,"topic":"财务度量（COPQ）","bok":"II","difficulty":1,"question":"当黑带正在写一份财务对六西格玛项目影响的报告。下列哪个测量对高级管理层最有意义？","options":["每百万机会缺陷(DPMO)","Cpk 研究结果","劣质质量成本(COPQ)","直通率(RTY)"],"answer":2,"explanation":"对高层管理者最有意义的是以货币计量的劣质质量成本（COPQ），直接体现六西格玛的财务影响。","question_en":"When the black belt-is writing a report on the financial impact of the Six Sigma project. Which of the following measuresis most meaningful to senior management?","options_en":["Defects per Hundred Opportunities (DPMO)","CPk study results","Cost of Poor Quality (COPQ)","Through rate (RTY)"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-133","set":5,"qno":133,"page":32,"topic":"利益相关方管理","bok":"III","difficulty":1,"question":"如果两个重要的利益相关方没有参加项目发布会议，项目领导应采取下列哪个措施？","options":["让他们解决缺席原因","给他们项目会议的复印件","确保他们了解在项目中的作用","和他们的主管联系并说明项目的重要性"],"answer":2,"explanation":"关键利益相关方缺席发布会议时，应确保其理解自身在项目中的角色与责任，以保障后续推行。","figure":false},
{"id":"T5-134","set":5,"qno":134,"page":32,"topic":"领导力职责","bok":"I","difficulty":1,"question":"高级管理者在六西格玛项目中的职责之一是","options":["选择项目团队成员","选择六西格玛的方法","为项目分配资源","实施过程改进"],"answer":2,"explanation":"高层管理者（高管/倡导者）的职责之一是为六西格玛项目分配所需资源。","figure":false},
{"id":"T5-135","set":5,"qno":135,"page":32,"topic":"标杆（Benchmarking）","bok":"II","difficulty":1,"question":"实施下列哪项是对标杆方法的最好描述","options":["竞争性评价","战略计划","客户声音分析","技术分析"],"answer":0,"explanation":"标杆管理本质是对标最佳实践的竞争性/比较性评价，用以发现差距并改进。","figure":false},
{"id":"T5-136","set":5,"qno":136,"page":32,"topic":"威布尔分布形态参数","bok":"V","difficulty":1,"question":"威布尔曲线大致像正态分布时，β参数取值多少？","options":["=0.5","=1","=3.5","=0"],"answer":2,"explanation":"威布尔分布当形状参数 β≈3~3.5 时形态近似正态，故β=3.5（选项2）。","figure":false},
{"id":"T5-137","set":5,"qno":137,"page":32,"topic":"项目目标与评估标准","bok":"IV","difficulty":1,"question":"六西格玛项目团队为了评估过程目标，必须满足下列哪个条件？","options":["团队应该在项目测量阶段建立评估标准","团队应该同意评估标准是项目开始的一部分","团队成员应该在整个项目规定期间应该根据他们个人表现提交筛选评估","促进者应该在第一次会议建立团队目标和目的"],"answer":1,"explanation":"为评估过程目标，团队应在项目启动时即就评估标准达成一致，使其成为项目目标的一部分。","figure":false},
{"id":"T5-138","set":5,"qno":138,"page":33,"topic":"投资回报率(ROI)","bok":"II","difficulty":1,"question":"团队计算项目在资金和成本上的节约，并对比完成项目花费。这种评价类型是","options":["净资产回顾","投资回报率","净收益","常规的管理费用"],"answer":2,"explanation":"将项目节约与成本相减得到的评价为净收益（net benefit）；题干“计算节约并对比花费”即收益减成本的净收益分析。","question_en":"The team calculates the savings in funds and costs of the project, and compares the cost of completing the project. This type of evaluation is","options_en":["Review of net assets","Return on investment","Net income","Regular management fees"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-139","set":5,"qno":139,"page":33,"topic":"关键绩效指标(KPI)","bok":"II","difficulty":1,"question":"一个关键绩效指标被定义为什么样的业务度量","options":["评估战略目标流程","识别减少浪费的机会","识别削减成本的机会","是独立的组织战略"],"answer":0,"explanation":"关键绩效指标（KPI）是用于评估战略目标实现过程的核心业务度量。","question_en":"A key performance indicator is defined as what kind of business measurement","options_en":["Process of evaluating strategic objectives","Identify opportunities to reduce waste","Identify cost-cutting opportunities","is an independent organizational strategy"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-140","set":5,"qno":140,"page":33,"topic":"DFSS方法（DMADV）","bok":"IX","difficulty":1,"question":"下列哪项是在构成六西格玛设计(DFSS)的方法？","options":["设计失效模式及影响分析（DFMEA）","失效模式以效果分析（FMEA）","DMAIC","DMADV"],"answer":3,"explanation":"六西格玛设计（DFSS）的典型路径是 DMADV（定义-测量-分析-设计-验证），区别于改进阶段的 DMAIC。","question_en":"Which of the following methodologies is a form of design for six sigma(DFSS)?","options_en":["Design failure mode and effect analysis(DFMEA)","Failure mode and effect analysis(FMEA)","DMAIC","DMADV"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-141","set":5,"qno":141,"page":33,"topic":"战略目标分解（树图）","bok":"I","difficulty":1,"question":"下列哪种工具可以在执行战略目标时用来细分任务","options":["亲和图","相互关系图","树图","柏拉图"],"answer":2,"explanation":"树图（Tree Diagram）可将战略目标自上而下逐层展开为具体任务与措施。","question_en":"Which of the following tools can be used to break/ down the tasks for implementing a strategic objective?","options_en":["Affinity diagram","Correlation diagram","Tree diagram","Plato"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-142","set":5,"qno":142,"page":33,"topic":"单样本Z假设检验","bok":"VI","difficulty":2,"question":"一个系统经理应知道对某台机器的平均响应时间是否超过 70 毫秒，做了 16 次实验，结果表明平均响应时间为 74.02ms，标准偏差是 8ms。如果 α=0.05，可以得出下列什么结论？","options":["Z=2.01；平均响应时间超出 70ms","Z=2.01；平均响应时间不超过 70ms","Z=1.96；平均响应时间超出 70ms","Z=1.96；平均响应时间不超过 70ms"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Z=(74.02−70)/(8/√16)=4.02/2=2.01；单侧α=0.05临界值1.645，2.01>1.645，故拒绝原假设，平均响应时间超过70ms（选项0）。","question_en":"A system manager should know whether the average response time to a certainmachine exceeds 70 milliseconds. After doing 16 experiments, the results show that the average responsel time is 74.02ms and the standard deviation is 8ms. If a =0.05, the following can be obtained What conclusion?","options_en":["Z=2.01; the average response time exceeds 70ms","Z=2.01; the average response time does not exceed 70ms","Z=1.96; the average response time exceeds 70ms","Z=1.96, the average response time does not exceed 70ms"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-143","set":5,"qno":143,"page":34,"topic":"团队宪章","bok":"IV","difficulty":1,"question":"小组宪章的目的是","options":["制定团队存在的原因","识别团队组长","解释团队解决问题工具","开发团队客户报告"],"answer":0,"explanation":"团队宪章（Team Charter）阐明团队存在的原因、目标与授权范围，是团队成立的依据。","question_en":"The purpose of a team charter is to","options_en":["Establish why the team exist","Identify the team leader","Explain team problem-solving tools","Develop the team's customer reports"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-144","set":5,"qno":144,"page":34,"topic":"直方图双峰原因","bok":"V","difficulty":1,"question":"当直方图有双峰时，最可能的原因是？","options":["测量器具中有随机波动","流程失控","数据从不同操作员而来","过程漂移"],"answer":2,"explanation":"直方图出现双峰通常表明数据来自两个不同总体/来源（如不同操作员、设备、班次混在一起）。","question_en":"Which of the following is the most likely cause when a histogram has two peaks?","options_en":["Random variation in the measuring device used","A process that is out of control","Data from different operators","Process drift"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-145","set":5,"qno":145,"page":34,"topic":"收益/成本比率与项目选择","bok":"IV","difficulty":1,"question":"在用来项目管理中，收益对成本比率变化通常用于","options":["判断项目的实际成本","计算项目的真实成本","项目的优先选择","分配合适资源"],"answer":2,"explanation":"收益/成本比率（BCR）常用于在项目组合中按投入产出比进行优先级排序与选择。","question_en":"In project management, a benefit-cost ratio is most commonly used to","options_en":["Justify a project's actual cost","Calculate a project's true cost","Prioritize projects","Allocate appropriate resources"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-146","set":5,"qno":146,"page":34,"topic":"VOC/客户期望","bok":"IV","difficulty":1,"question":"以客户为中心的组织里，下面哪个是关键驱动因素","options":["确定过程绩效","确定质量期望","预测过程变差","预测供应商需求"],"answer":1,"explanation":"以客户为中心的组织，其关键驱动因素是明确客户的质量期望（CTQ），并据此展开过程设计。","question_en":"Which of the following elements is a key driver in a customer-focused organization?","options_en":["Determining process performance","Determining quality expectations","Predicting process variation","Predicting supplier demands"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-147","set":5,"qno":147,"page":34,"topic":"标准化工作（精益）","bok":"VII","difficulty":1,"question":"一个技术员被调到公司内部不同部门，但仍能做同样的工作。技术员发现这个新部门中的工作完成方法显著不同。下面哪些工具可以帮助消除这些差异？","options":["防错法","5S","工作标准化","优先矩阵表"],"answer":2,"explanation":"工作标准化（Standard Work）可将同一工作的做法统一，消除跨部门执行差异。","question_en":"A technician has been moved to a different department of the company but is performing the same job. The technician finds that the job functions are performed significantly differently in the new department. Which of the following tools would help to eliminate these differences?","options_en":["poka--yoke","5s","Standard work","Prioritization matrices"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-148","set":5,"qno":148,"page":35,"topic":"推断性统计（抽样验收）","bok":"V","difficulty":1,"question":"某公司的质保经理正试图根据 50 个样本的检验数据来决定是接受还是拒收最近一批产品。该经理应借助下列哪种工具来做决定？","options":["推断性统计","总体参数","数据编码","100%检验"],"answer":0,"explanation":"依据样本数据对整批产品做接受/拒收决策属于抽样验收，依赖推断性统计。","question_en":"The quality assurance manager of a company is trying to decide whether to accept or reject the latest shipment of product, based on inspection data from a sample of 50. which of the following tools should the manager use to make the decision?","options_en":["Inferential statistics","Population parameters","Data coding","100% inspection"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-149","set":5,"qno":149,"page":35,"topic":"多变量图","bok":"V","difficulty":1,"question":"以下哪个工具可以被用来比较零件之间测量数据并探测数据的变化模式和相互关系？","options":["过程图","鱼骨图","排列图","多变量图"],"answer":3,"explanation":"多变量图（Multi-vari chart）用于比较不同零件/条件下的测量值并揭示变异的模式与相互作用。","question_en":"Which of the following tools can be used to compare within-part measurements and detect patterns and relationships in the data?","options_en":["Process map","Fishbone diagram","Pareto chart","Multi-vari chart"],"figure":false},
{"id":"T5-150","set":5,"qno":150,"page":35,"topic":"甘特图（项目时间管理）","bok":"IV","difficulty":1,"question":"甘特图用于显示","options":["流程中每个步骤的资源和成果","项目任务之间的关系和时间限制","分项数据的相对频数","问题的潜在原因"],"answer":1,"explanation":"甘特图以时间轴展示各项任务的进度、先后关系与时间约束，便于项目时间管理。","question_en":"A Gantt chart is used to show the","options_en":["Resources and outcomes for each step in the process","Relationships among project tasks, and the time constraints","Relative frequency of data divided into categories","Potential cause of a problem"],"figure":false}
